    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWell-presented three-bedroom bungalow, situated on a well-defined, low-maintenance site. This property is located in Dunmaynor, a quiet, peaceful townland, just 1km from Killasser village, and 8km from Swinford. Ireland West Airport Knock is less than 20km away. \n\nThe property comes to the market in good condition and is ready for immediate occupation. It is constructed of mass concrete with a pitched, slate roof. It has recently been renovated and is presented in very good condition. \n\nThe property is heated with oil-fired central heating and there are double glazed windows throughout. \n\nThe property is ideal for a variety of buyers, including investors, first-time buyers, those looking to downsize, or if you are looking for an easy-to-maintain holiday home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - 1.6m x 3.0m\nWith lmainate floor.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.2m x 4.7m\nDouble room to the front to the house with lamiante floor.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.6m x 2.6m\nDouble room to the front to the house with lamiante floor.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.9m x 4.7m\nDouble room to the rear to the house with lamiante floor and Sitra access to teh attic.\n\nBathroom - 2.2m x 1.9m\nFully tiled with WC, wash hand basin and wet-style walk-in shower.\n\nKitchen/Living Room - 4.6m x 5.9m\nLarge bright open plan room with laminate floor, fitted kitchen and solid fuel stove.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Large, Low Maintanence Site. </li><li>Quiet Area. </li><li>Garden to Front and Rear. </li><li>Off-Street Parking.</ul>"
      },
